# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Pages already sends
# X-Content-Type-Options and Referrer-Policy. A CSP comes later: the inline
# theme script, Astro islands and Umami need hashes or allowlists first.
# Applies to dev too, so never put noindex here.

/*
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

# hashed filenames, safe to cache for good
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
